<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Chennai to Mysore | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage do I receive for my bike during transport from Chennai to Mysore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every bike shipped with us is covered by a 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy, which protects the declared value against loss, theft, or damage. In the unlikely event of a claim, you receive a full reimbursement after a swift verification process, ensuring complete peace of mind throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long will it take for my bike to reach Mysore after pickup in Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our dedicated fleet guarantees door‑to‑door delivery within 24‑48 hours on the NH 16 corridor. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress, and our experienced drivers adhere to a strict schedule that balances speed with meticulous handling to avoid any transit scratches.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I get an instant price quote for shipping my bike from Chennai to Mysore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our online instant quote tool requires only basic bike details, preferred service tier, and pickup location. Within seconds you receive a transparent, GST‑inclusive price that breaks down freight, fuel surcharge, insurance, and any optional premium packing, so there are no hidden costs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes your 7‑layer packaging different from standard bike packing methods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer framework combines high‑density foam edge protectors, 80‑GSM bubble wrap, corrugated fiberboard, weather‑proof stretch film, custom wooden crates, anti‑vibration straps, and full insurance. Each layer addresses a specific risk—impact, vibration, moisture, and theft—providing a comprehensive shield that standard single‑layer methods cannot match.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide any special handling for high‑value or antique motorcycles?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. For high‑value or antique bikes we offer bespoke wooden crates, extra foam padding, and a dedicated handling crew trained in vintage vehicle care. The insurance coverage can be increased to match the bike’s appraised value, ensuring both physical and financial protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for bike transport from Chennai to Mysore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, and a signed consignment note. For corporate or government reimbursements, we also provide GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills. Our team assists you in preparing all paperwork to ensure a smooth, hassle‑free transfer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do hydraulic ramp trailers prevent scratches during loading and unloading?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramps lower smoothly, eliminating abrupt drops that can cause scratches. The ramps are equipped with non‑slip surfaces and wheel chocks, while the enclosed carrier’s interior is lined with soft foam mats. Together they secure the bike firmly, ensuring a scratch‑free experience from pickup to delivery.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
